{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/30d9bc1668ebd64d64b7bc9e021fc11e.webp?t=1663507796\" width=800 height=43 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/6a52704ada985f9b397e4e3e79d0dad1.avif?t=1663507796\" width=604 height=340 /></span><br>Far away, at the foot of the snowy mountains, there is a village called Ereb. There is a rumor about this village, it says, &quot;devouring everything, there is no return&quot;.<br><br>A sugar glider detective ignores the advice and goes to the Ereb Village alone. In addition, to finding the truth, she is looking forward to getting someone's clues. <br><br>Ask the villagers, get clues and get closer to the truth. But before that, why are all the villagers falling asleep?<br><br>Let's find a way to wake up the villagers first. The detective launches a search in Ereb Village.<br><br>Short branch, looks like it'll work. Little windmill, why are the blades loose\uff1f Does the round sun blink its eyes just now?<br><br>As the villagers wake up, the truth about Ereb Village comes to light. At the same time, the detective's own memory is gradually awakened...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/1033b5da3fce2d0229ec3769c09ba6cc.webp?t=1663507796\" width=800 height=43 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/861cc33ead6212f972ca24fa4885100b.avif?t=1663507796\" width=581 height=203 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/8957f41c16d19d7805fc5ec59c0e5c37.avif?t=1663507796\" width=581 height=203 