uzzles</strong>, so make sure you interact with them on the <strong>detail page</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.poster.avif?t=1663507796\" width=604 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.webm?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/dc70a1f1cf4abc76e4b4efd15aff0ee7.mp4?t=1663507796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2081460?t=1663507796","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1663507796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1663507796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1663507796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Follow Us</h1><p>Don't want to miss the latest news of Breeze? Follow us here:<br>Youtube: <br>Instagram: <br>Twitter: <br>Weibo: <br>bilibili: </p><br><h1>Looking forward to your feedback</h1><p>After you have played our game, we look forward to getting your feedback in the comment section or in the Google Form below.<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081460/extras/30d9bc1668ebd64d64b7bc9e021fc11e.webp?t=1663507796\" width=800 height=43 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it